/*QUAKED event_manager (0 0.5 0.8) (-8 -8 -8) (8 8 8)
Event manager

Runs the Slender gameplay loop: page music, collectibles, keys, aggression and Slender Man spawning. Use one per map. Removed in deathmatch. Its targetname is always set to sm_event_manager.

Pages, mementos and keys are created from info_page_spot, info_memento_spot and info_key_spot. Slender Man spawns at a random info_slender: 1 on Easy and Normal, 2 on Hard, 4 on Nightmare, always 1 with the Weeping Angel AI. The Weeping Angel AI waits for the first collectible before it spawns and before aggression starts.

Aggression = (collectibles * count + keys * cnt + failed door attempts * frags) * skill multiplier + passive aggression, clamped to 1..armorvalue. Skill multiplier: 0.5 Easy, 1 Normal, 1.25 Hard, 1.5 Nightmare. A non-zero cvar scratch1 overrides it (clamped to 0.5..2).

While an event_manager exists, touching any func_door runs the Slender key door logic instead of the gold and silver key flags (see func_door key_targetname).

-------- KEYS --------
"wait" Collectibles needed on Easy and Normal. Default: 0.
Applies to pages and to mementos. If 0, the code counts the item_page entities present when event_manager spawns, capped at 8. Pages are created later from info_page_spot, so that count is normally 0 and no collectibles appear. Set this key.
"dmg" Collectibles needed on Hard and Nightmare. Default: 10.
"distance" Keys needed on Easy and Normal. Default: 0.
"volume" Keys needed on Hard and Nightmare. Default: 0.
"sounds" Page music set. Default: 1 (Eight Pages (4-step progression)).
  1 = Eight Pages (4-step progression)
  2 = 7th Street (6-step progression)
  3 = Prison (6-step progression)
"weapon" Tracks in the music set. Default: 4.
Used together with sounds to offset the CD track numbers of the set.
"style" Slender Man AI style. Default: 0 (Eight Pages).
  0 = Eight Pages
  1 = Slender Man's Shadow
  2 = Weeping Angel (Prison)
"armorvalue" Maximum aggression. Default: 0.
If 0: 8 with the Eight Pages AI (10 on Hard and Nightmare), 100 with the other AI styles (120 on Hard and Nightmare).
"count" Aggression per collectible. Default: 1.
"cnt" Aggression per key. Default: 0.
"frags" Aggression per failed door attempt. Default: 0.
Counted each time a player touches a func_door without the matching key.
"delay" Passive aggression interval (seconds). Default: 300.
Seconds of play with active players between passive aggression increases.
"ltime" Passive aggression per interval. Default: 1.
*/

