/*QUAKED monster_zombie (0.86 0 0) (-16 -16 -24) (16 16 32) CRUCIFIED AMBUSH - - - - - - NOT_ON_EASY NOT_ON_NORMAL NOT_ON_HARD NOT_IN_DEATHMATCH
{
model({{ spawnflags & 1 -> {"path":"progs/zombie.mdl", "frame": 192}, "progs/zombie.mdl" }});
}
Zombie

They rip pieces of their flesh off themselves and throw them as their attack. They have 60HP and to kill them they must be gibbed using up their full HP. If you do not, they will simply fall over, regenerate to full HP and get up again.

-------- KEYS --------
"angle" Direction.
"target" Target.
"killtarget" Killtarget.
"targetname" Name.

-------- SPAWNFLAGS --------
CRUCIFIED (1) : Crucified. The Zombie will become a writhing crucified Zombie prop that can be used as level decoration and is not treated as a monster in game.
AMBUSH (2) : Ambush. The Zombie will not wake up from seeing other monsters wake up or hearing sounds.
NOT_ON_EASY (256) : Not on Easy
NOT_ON_NORMAL (512) : Not on Normal
NOT_ON_HARD (1024) : Not on Hard
NOT_IN_DEATHMATCH (2048) : Not in Deathmatch
*/

