/*QUAKED trap_spikeshooter (0 0.5 0.8) (-8 -8 -8) (8 8 8) SUPERSPIKE LASER - - - - - - NOT_ON_EASY NOT_ON_NORMAL NOT_ON_HARD NOT_IN_DEATHMATCH
{
model({{ spawnflags & 2 -> ":progs/laser.mdl", spawnflags & 1 -> ":progs/s_spike.mdl", ":progs/s_spike.mdl" }});
}
Triggered shooter

Fires a stream of spikes when triggered. By default it fires a normal spike doing 9 HP of damage, and by setting it's spawnflags can be made to fire a 18 HP superspike or a 15 HP laser shot.

-------- KEYS --------
"targetname" Name.

-------- SPAWNFLAGS --------
no flag : Spike. 9 HP
SUPERSPIKE (1) : Superspike. 18 HP
LASER (2) : Laser. 15 HP
NOT_ON_EASY (256) : Not on Easy
NOT_ON_NORMAL (512) : Not on Normal
