/*QUAKED trap_shooter (0.86 0.59 0.59) (-8 -8 -8) (8 8 8) SUPERSPIKE LASER - - - - - - NOT_ON_EASY NOT_ON_NORMAL NOT_ON_HARD NOT_IN_DEATHMATCH
{
model({{ spawnflags & 2 -> ":progs/laser.mdl", spawnflags & 1 -> ":progs/s_spike.mdl", ":progs/s_spike.mdl" }});
}
Continuous shooter

Fires continous stream of spikes with options to delay the 1st shot and then set a single delay time of every shot there after. By default it fires a normal spike doing 9 HP of damage, and by setting it's spawnflags can be made to fire a 18 HP superspike or a 15 HP laser shot.

-------- KEYS --------
"nextthink" Delay before first spike.
"wait" Delay between spikes.

-------- SPAWNFLAGS --------
no flag : Spike. 9 HP
SUPERSPIKE (1) : Superspike. 18 HP
LASER (2) : Laser. 15 HP
NOT_ON_EASY (256) : Not on Easy
NOT_ON_NORMAL (512) : Not on Normal
NOT_ON_HARD (1024) : Not on Hard
NOT_IN_DEATHMATCH (2048) : Not in Deathmatch
*/

